Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.89,0:00:06.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,On November 15th, 2023 YG\NEntertainment posted a notice that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.03,0:00:11.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,stopped a fandom cold Their most\Nanticipated trainee the girl fans had
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.15,0:00:15.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,already crowned before she ever\Nofficially debuted would not be in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:20.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,group's first music video Six members\Nwould go on without her One would stay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:26.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,behind unnamed in a building full of\Nmirrors What happened next is the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.93,0:00:31.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,strangest debut arc in modern K-pop a\Ngroup that broke YouTube records
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.15,0:00:34.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,without its center a record label that\Nrefused to replace her
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.21,0:00:39.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,and a nineteen-year-old who came back\Nfrom the edge of erasure to become the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.93,0:00:45.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,defining idol of her generation This\Nis the story of Jung Ahyeon and why
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:48.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,the industry now calls her the fifth\Ngeneration's it girl
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:03.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ahyeon The fifth generation it girl
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.99,0:01:24.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,Act One Chuncheon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.67,0:01:46.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Before the pyramids of light and the\Ndome-sized crowds there is a map dot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.19,0:01:52.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,two hours east of Seoul Chuncheon a\Nlakeside city in Gangwon Province
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.35,0:01:57.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,known for its dumplings its autumn\Nleaves and almost nothing else in the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.00,0:02:02.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,global music economy On\NApril 11th, 2007 Jung Ahyeon was born
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.78,0:02:07.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,there By her own fans' accounting she\Nwas studying English at five and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.10,0:02:11.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mandarin by seven a trilingual\Nchildhood in a city that has produced
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.23,0:02:13.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,exactly one global idol
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.67,0:02:29.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,Somewhere between eight and ten years\Nold she entered the system that would
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.97,0:02:34.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,rebuild her life around a single\Nobjective YG Entertainment the company
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.39,0:02:40.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,of BigBang of 2NE1 of Blackpink\Nruns the most selective and most
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.90,0:02:45.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,secretive training program in K-pop\NTrainees practice six to ten hours a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.07,0:02:50.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,day for years without a debut date\Nwithout a guarantee and in most cases
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.57,0:02:55.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,without the public ever learning their\Nname Ahyeon lasted five years in that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.57,0:03:01.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,machine Hold on to that number Five\Nyears of auditions evaluations and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:05.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,eliminations before the outside world\Nsaw her face move
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:24.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,The first public signal came on New\NYear's Day 2023 A trailer called YG
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.94,0:03:28.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Next Movement ninety seconds of\Nanonymous trainees dancing like the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:34.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,floor owed them money The internet did\Nwhat the internet does it froze frames
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:39.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,zoomed faces and started building fan\Naccounts for children whose names had
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.14,0:03:45.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,never been spoken Eleven days later YG\Nbegan answering One by one it released
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.33,0:03:50.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,live performance videos of the members\NAhyeon was the second reveal She was
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:54.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,fifteen years old performing\Nchoreography she had been drilling for
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.53,0:03:57.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,half a decade and the comments read\Nlike a launch event
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.26,0:04:15.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,Behind the scenes the selection was\Nbeing filmed Last Evaluation YG's own
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.85,0:04:21.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,documentary series followed seven\Ntrainees competing for a lineup no one
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.25,0:04:25.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,would guarantee The footage showed a\Ncompany deliberately withholding the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:30.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,answer letting the girls and the\Naudience sit inside the uncertainty
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.93,0:04:35.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ahyeon made the label's shortlist of\Nfive as the complete package
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.53,0:04:40.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,a kid from Chuncheon who sang in\NEnglish at five Mandarin at seven and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.37,0:04:44.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,danced like she'd been on stage since\Nshe was five Not a reference A first
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:50.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,language music The question was never\Nwhether she fit an old mold but
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.21,0:04:54.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,whether YG was ready to build a new\Ngroup around a voice that refused to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.46,0:04:55.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,fit one
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:10.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,Act Two The voice they heard first
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:32.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,Here is the detail that separates\NAhyeon's origin from every trainee
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:39.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,handbook Before BABYMONSTER had a name\Na logo or a debut date a video leaked
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:43.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,out of the practice rooms a teenage\Ngirl singing Charlie Puth's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.75,0:05:50.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,Dangerously alone one take no stage no\Nstyling It spread the way genuine
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.14,0:05:55.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,things spread unannounced and\Nunkillable And then it reached the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:59.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,person who wrote the song Charlie Puth\Ndidn't just notice it He said publicly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.86,0:06:03.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,that he had heard the cover and that\Nthe voice had stopped him
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.76,0:06:20.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,On May 14th, 2023 the group released\NDream a pre-debut single that hit
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.67,0:06:24.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,number one on Billboard's Hot Trending\NSongs chart before the group had
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.65,0:06:29.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,officially debuted The YouTube channel\Ncrossed one million subscribers in
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.51,0:06:34.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,fifty-two days the fastest in K-pop\Ngirl group history at the time
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.56,0:06:39.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,Industry watchers kept asking the same\Nquestion why was YG building so much
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.34,0:06:44.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,momentum for a group with no release\Ndate The answer it turned out was that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:48.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,the date kept moving because the\Nlineup wasn't finished One voice was
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.73,0:06:49.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,missing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.70,0:07:04.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,Inside the company Ahyeon was being\Nshaped as a specific weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.15,0:07:10.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,main vocalist lead rapper lead dancer\Ncenter That is four job descriptions
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.57,0:07:16.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,on one person and each one is normally\Na full-time specialty The rare idols
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.41,0:07:22.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,who carry all four are the ones the\Nindustry builds eras around YG had a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.77,0:07:26.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,term for what it saw in her and fans\Nhad theirs Both meant the same thing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.98,0:07:29.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,the group's identity was designed\Naround a voice that could carry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.81,0:07:35.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,hip-hop swagger on one track and pure\Npop ache on the next without changing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.88,0:07:35.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,costumes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.22,0:07:51.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Puth thread didn't end with the\Ncover Two years later when the group
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.35,0:07:55.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,finally released its first album track\Nfour would be called Like That
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.56,0:08:00.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,written and gifted by Charlie Puth\Nhimself explicitly in response to that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.19,0:08:05.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,practice-room video Remember the\Nsequence because it matters a cover
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.89,0:08:09.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,made in anonymity went up the chain\Nreached the original artist and came
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.81,0:08:14.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,back down as a song on a debut album\NIn an industry where Western features
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.27,0:08:19.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,are bought and negotiated one of the\Nbiggest pop writers on Earth handed a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.91,0:08:22.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,debut track to a trainee he had never\Nmet
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.56,0:08:35.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,Act Three The wait
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.38,0:08:59.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,November 15th, 2023 The notice was\Nthree sentences long YG announced that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:03.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ahyeon would not participate in the\Ngroup's debut activities citing health
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:09.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,and personal circumstances She would\Nremain a member of BABYMONSTER No
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.43,0:09:15.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,timeline No diagnosis No footage In\NK-pop where a nine-month hiatus can
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.78,0:09:20.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,quietly end a career the announcement\Nread like a countdown nobody could see
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.06,0:09:22.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,She was sixteen years old
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.14,0:09:37.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,Twelve days later the six-member\NBABYMONSTER released Batter Up The
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.38,0:09:42.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,numbers were absurd twenty-two point\Nfive nine million views in twenty-four
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.89,0:09:47.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,hours at that moment the most-viewed\Ndebut music video in K-pop history One
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.49,0:09:53.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,hundred million views in eighteen days\NThe group had arrived loudly
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:58.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,undeniably and every article every\Ncomment every frame of choreography
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.70,0:10:04.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,carried the same asterisk Six of seven\NThe debut was a triumph shaped exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.61,0:10:05.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,like an absence
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:21.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,Twenty-two point five nine million\Nviews in the first twenty-four hours
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.37,0:10:37.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,February 2024 brought Stuck In The\NMiddle
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.81,0:10:42.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,a ballad-adjacent single that\Nshowcased the group's softer register
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.36,0:10:47.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,Again six members Again the comments\NBy then the absence had become the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:52.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,group's most-discussed member Fan\Ncampaigns for her return ran in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.18,0:10:56.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,multiple languages and multiple time\Nzones the fandom's nickname for the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:11:02.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,wait worth the wait stopped being a\Nslogan and became a prediction Inside
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:07.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,YG sources say the decision had\Nalready been made The company did not
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.01,0:11:12.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,refilm did not re-cast did not\Nre-shuffle It waited for her
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:30.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,In the early spring of 2024 YG posted\Na notice that fans screenshot like a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.37,0:11:34.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,birth certificate\NAhyeon would rejoin the group The
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:39.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,seven-member rebrand was baked into\Nthe identity itself the debut EP would
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.06,0:11:45.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,be stylized BABYMONS7ER the numeral\Nseven welded into the wordmark Think
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.89,0:11:51.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,about how rare that is Labels replace\Nmembers Labels delay debuts Labels
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.07,0:11:56.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,almost never architect the comeback of\Na trainee who never debuted into the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.42,0:12:00.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,group's founding mythology The missing\Ngirl was about to become the founding
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:01.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,story
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.34,0:12:27.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Act Four Worth the wait
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.30,0:12:51.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,April 1st, 2024 Seven members\NBABYMONS7ER The debut EP pulled over
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.73,0:12:56.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,four hundred sixty thousand pre-orders\Nand landed at number three on Korea's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.10,0:13:00.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,Circle Album Chart The title track\NSheesh was engineered as a statement
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.69,0:13:05.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,brass stabs chant hooks a drop built\Nfor stadiums and it climbed to the top
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.66,0:13:10.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,ten of the Circle Digital Chart while\Nposting the highest Spotify debut of
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.20,0:13:15.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,any K-pop girl group that year The\Ncenter of its choreography and of
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.81,0:13:19.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,nearly every camera move was the girl\Nwho had missed the countdown
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.67,0:13:35.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,And there on the album sat the\Nfull-circle moment Like That Written
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.39,0:13:40.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,by Charlie Puth Gifted by his own\Naccount because a practice-room cover
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.22,0:13:44.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,had once stopped him mid-scroll Ahyeon\Ndidn't just get her debut
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.31,0:13:48.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,she got a debut where one of the\Nworld's biggest pop writers had
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.40,0:13:52.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,personally co-signed the voice the\Nindustry spent sixteen months waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.47,0:13:57.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,to hear Critics noticed what YG had\Nbet on the group's seven-member sound
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:13:59.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,finally had its missing ceiling
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.17,0:14:15.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,The press cycle wanted a shortcut a\Nreference a familiar frame to explain
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.72,0:14:20.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,a new face Ahyeon didn't give them one\NHer answer was never a press release
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.99,0:14:26.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,It was a body of work a rapper's bite\Non variety shows live vocals that kept
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.06,0:14:30.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,getting steadier under the harshest\Nopen mics choreography that read clean
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.75,0:14:36.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,on a phone screen and even cleaner on\Na 55,000-seat dome cam The fifth
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.01,0:14:41.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,generation didn't need a repeat It\Nneeded a first and she was already
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.16,0:14:43.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,becoming it one stage at a time
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:58.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,The industry's verdict arrived through\Narithmetic Within two months of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:03.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,debuting the group was booked across\Nsix Asian territories on a fan-meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.17,0:15:08.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,tour selling twenty-six thousand\Ntickets in Tokyo alone Music show
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.19,0:15:13.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,stages turned into trending clips\Nweekly The machine that had spent 2019
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:20.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,through 2023 being called too slow too\Nquiet too old-fashioned YG's patient
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.27,0:15:24.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,scarcity-driven training model had\Njust produced the fastest-scaling girl
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.73,0:15:29.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,group of the new generation And at the\Ncenter of the frame was the one it had
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.39,0:15:30.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,refused to replace
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.70,0:15:44.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,Act Five The monster era
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:05.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,The singles kept the temperature up\NForever that July
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.05,0:16:10.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,ran the group's bright-powered\Nregister into summer But the real move
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.91,0:16:15.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,came on November 1st, 2024 DRIP the\Nfirst studio album Eight hundred
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.62,0:16:20.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,twenty thousand copies in its first\Nweek for a group eleven months past
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:26.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,debut It crossed a million domestic\Ncopies landed on the Billboard 200 and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:31.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,its title track carried a co-sign no\None saw coming the demo was built by
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.00,0:16:35.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,G-Dragon The pupil of the company\Nhanded material by its architect
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.64,0:16:52.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then came the stat that redrew the\Ntour maps On January 25th and 26th
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:58.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,2025 BABYMONSTER opened their Hello\NMonsters world tour at the KSPO Dome
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.95,0:17:02.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,in Seoul the Olympic gymnastics arena\Nthat functions as K-pop's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.13,0:17:07.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,certification of arrival No girl group\Nhad ever headlined that venue faster
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.52,0:17:12.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,They were eight months past debut The\Ntour went on to play thirty-two shows
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:17.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,across twenty cities for roughly three\Nhundred thousand people with the Japan
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.13,0:17:21.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,leg alone moving a hundred and fifty\Nthousand tickets at a record pace
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:40.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,November 29th, 2025 the MAMA Awards in\NHong Kong Ahyeon Pharita and Rora took
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:44.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,the stage for a medley from KPop Demon\NHunters and their performance of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.41,0:17:49.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,Golden detonated the internet six\Npoint six eight million views the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.14,0:17:53.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,most-watched MAMA clip of the year\NThen came the part every idol learns
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:58.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,to dread the reaction economy Clips of\Nthe live vocals circulated with
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.81,0:18:04.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,criticism attached Ahyeon's response\Nwas not a statement It was the next
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.09,0:18:09.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,stage and the one after that each one\Ntighter until the argument ran out of
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:09.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,footage
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.80,0:18:26.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,Six point six eight million views the\Nmost-watched MAMA stage of the year
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.90,0:18:45.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,Zoom out and the year looks like this\Na million-copy album a dome-level
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.91,0:18:49.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,world tour four hundred forty thousand\Nfans through the turnstiles in twelve
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.05,0:18:53.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,months and a fanbase that had watched\Na sixteen-year-old almost disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.56,0:18:57.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,and come back as the group's\Ngravitational center By the end of
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.42,0:19:02.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,2025 the industry had stopped\Ndescribing BABYMONSTER as Blackpink's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.64,0:19:07.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,successors They were simply the\Nmonster era and Ahyeon was its face
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:20.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,Act Six The it girl year
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:42.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,By 2026 the metric wasn't views\Nanymore It was what happened when
